<title>USA: Stark says Europe must create one currency.</title>
<headline>Stark says Europe must create one currency.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A senior German finance ministry official said Wednesday Europe had no alternative but to create a common European currency for economic reasons.</p>
<p>&quot;We have in Europe no alternative and we have to create a common European currency for economic reasons,&quot; Juergen Stark, state secretary in Germany's Finance Ministry, said at an event sponsored by the American Council on Germany.</p>
<p>&quot;To create a common monetary unit in Europe is the next step, the most important step to further European integration.&quot; ((Roamme Daniels, 212-859-1677))</p>
</text>
